### Avoid

- Pitching the system before you know which problem is live.
- Filling silence with more messages - one question, then wait.
- Apologising for the fee or softening the price before they object.
- Sending a PDF or a long explainer when they ask for info - send the scorecard instead.
- Treating a neutral reply as a no and moving on.
- Matching their scepticism - stay steady and plain-spoken.
- Using coaching language in replies: transformation, journey, unlock, empower.
- More than one question per message - pick the one that matters most.

